/-!
# Canonical filtration of lifetime paths

The raw canonical filtration is generated by the cemetery-valued coordinates up to each time.
The lifetime is a stopping time because death by time `t` is exactly the event that the time-`t`
coordinate is the cemetery state.
-/

open MeasureTheory
open scoped ENNReal

